  description: '2+ monsters, including a Link Monster

    (This card is always
    treated as a "Sky Striker Ace" card.)

    Must first be Link Summoned. Loses
    3000 ATK while you have no Spells in your GY. When your opponent activates a
    card or effect as Chain Link 2 or higher (Quick Effect): You can banish 2 Spells
    from your hand and/or GY; negate that effect, then you can destroy 1 card your
    opponent controls. You can only use this effect of "Surgical Striker - S.P.E.C.T.R.A."
    once per turn.'
